    <worksheet name='Recommendations'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true'>Recommendation: Target Campaign 7 by Persona</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>Based on segmentation and campaign analysis:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>PRIMARY TARGET: Premium Loyalists (n=481, 22% of customers)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Highest response rate: 26%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Highest revenue contribution: $684K</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Channel: Catalog and Store</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Campaign type: Premium product launches</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>SECONDARY TARGET: Discount-Driven Families (n=300, 13%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Strong response rate: 20%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Channel: Web and Deals</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Campaign type: Promotional offers, bundles</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>DEPRIORITIZE: Disengaged Budget Customers (n=975, 44%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Response rate of only 8%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Lowest revenue per customer ($89)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>- Reduce campaign spend; reactivation only</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>PROJECTED IMPACT</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Targeting only the top 2 personas (n=781, 35% of base) is projected to lift response rate from the historical 15% baseline to approximately 24%, while reducing campaign send volume by 65%.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources />
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='table'>
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{971F3227-D201-464D-98C2-D00B239DEE2C}' />
    </worksheet>
